        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">These robust units are ideal for Whitesboro properties, offering accessible protection within your home, garage, or even as a modular safe room in a barn or outbuilding on your ranch. They are designed for quick entry during severe weather.</p>
