        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">For those in Whitesboro seeking a discreet and highly protective option, our underground storm shelters provide ultimate safety from tornadoes. Installed in your yard, they offer secure refuge below ground level.</p>
